{
  "nl": "用 antd 风格做工单管理：查询有标题；表格展示标题、优先级、负责人、升级原因；支持新增、编辑、删除。表单里「升级原因」在优先级为「低」，或尚未填写负责人时隐藏。",
  "nlEn": "Ticket management with an Ant Design look: query by title; the table shows title, priority, assignee and escalation reason; supports add, edit and delete. In the form, the \"escalation reason\" is hidden when the priority is \"low\", or no assignee has been filled in yet.",
  "fixedFields": ["title", "priority", "assignee", "escalateReason"],
  "pinnedDims": ["propSet", "actions", "isHidden:escalateReason", "target"],
  "config": {
    "name": "TicketManage",
    "apiUrl": "/api/tickets",
    "target": "antdv",
    "fields": [
      { "prop": "title", "label": "标题", "formtype": "Input" },
      {
        "prop": "priority",
        "label": "优先级",
        "formtype": "Select",
        "dataOptions": [
          { "label": "高", "value": "high" },
          { "label": "中", "value": "medium" },
          { "label": "低", "value": "low" }
        ],
        "inQuery": false
      },
      { "prop": "assignee", "label": "负责人", "formtype": "Input", "inQuery": false },
      {
        "prop": "escalateReason",
        "label": "升级原因",
        "formtype": "Input",
        "inQuery": false,
        "isHidden": {
          "or": [
            { "==": [{ "var": "priority" }, "low"] },
            { "empty": [{ "var": "assignee" }] }
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
    "actions": ["add", "edit", "delete"]
  },
  "notes": "AI-16: 表达式 isHidden（跨字段 or）—— 低优先级或未指派负责人时隐藏升级原因（antdv/schema）"
}
